id: spirit-studied
name: Studied (Spirit of Namek)
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 10
# Not a Combat Condition: what Spirit of Namek's (2) gives an Ally it Studied, held on the Namekian's clock as long - its stacks
# their Tier.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Studied by an Ally's Spirit of Namek: Soak Value and Wound Rolls 1(T) higher while it lasts.
text: >
  Spirit of Namek (2): Increase the Soak Value and Wound Rolls of your Studied Allies by 1(T).

---

[passive]
soakValue += stacks;
wound += stacks;
